<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The UI ships in the user's own language. The German is the OUTPUT, not the interface.

  The product's German terms of art — Lebenslauf, Anschreiben, Anforderungsabgleich, DIN 5008,
  Anlagen, anabin, Mappe — stay German in every locale on purpose. They are the words the user
  will meet on the other side of the application, and swapping them for a translation would rob
  them of the vocabulary they actually need.

  HARD RULE: no emoji in any string here. EmojiFreeStringsTest fails the build if one appears.
-->
